1
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,280
Father,

2
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:14,770
does Mother's death

3
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:17,080
have anything to do with you?

4
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:22,800
I can explain.

5
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:24,720
Listen to me.

6
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:28,000
I did it for

7
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:30,680
Kuizhou City.

8
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:31,960
For...

9
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:34,040
For the people.

10
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:37,120
Ultimately, you did it for yourself.

11
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:39,080
Go explain it

12
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:42,840
to Mother.

13
00:01:30,320 --> 00:01:31,320
Madam. Madam,

14
00:01:31,320 --> 00:01:32,720
would you like to take this beauty fan?

15
00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:33,640
Go greet them.

16
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:34,680
Madam,

17
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:36,400
please come in.

18
00:01:38,759 --> 00:01:39,400
Madam,

19
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:41,080
would you like to take this beauty fan?

20
00:01:41,080 --> 00:01:41,920
Madam.

21
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:47,800
This is personally blended by our Pavilion Master

22
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:49,840
using magnolia juice.

23
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:51,000
I'm here

24
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:52,280
to get my makeup done.

25
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:55,200
I want the 'Natural Elegance' look.

26
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:56,640
Go.

27
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:02,400
You have great taste, Madam.

28
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:04,260
Are you attending a banquet or...

29
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,360
I'm going to

30
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:08,080
Jinxiuxuan for a job interview

31
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,440
to be a clothes envoy.

32
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:12,880
Their new Yanluo yarn

33
00:02:12,880 --> 00:02:14,320
suits a slender figure best.

34
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:16,079
The Pavilion Master often says 'Natural Elegance'

35
00:02:16,079 --> 00:02:18,079
means to have one's own natural beauty.

36
00:02:18,079 --> 00:02:19,079
A woman's beauty

37
00:02:19,079 --> 00:02:20,680
should be like the flowers and plants of the four seasons,

38
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:21,840
spring orchids and autumn chrysanthemums,

39
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:22,960
each with its own merits.

40
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:25,079
A healthy body is the most beautiful.

41
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:26,280
You just need to show

42
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:27,760
your truest self.

43
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:28,720
I believe

44
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:30,050
the boss will see it.

45
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:35,840
Thank you for your guidance, Pavilion Master.

46
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:41,040
Thanks for storing them.

47
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:42,040
Pavilion Master.

48
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:45,360
Your kindness is like a second life to me.

49
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:46,640
How could it be hard work?

50
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:48,100
If you hadn't reached out,

51
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:50,610
I'd still be struggling in that quagmire.

52
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:54,560
You were willing to reach out from the quagmire,

53
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:56,020
so you could catch my hand.

54
00:02:57,079 --> 00:02:58,120
Moreover,

55
00:02:58,240 --> 00:03:00,200
I found your bookkeeping skills

56
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:02,660
are even better than your makeup skills.

57
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:05,220
I'm just making the best use of your talents.

58
00:03:07,040 --> 00:03:08,000
Pavilion Master.

59
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:08,680
No need to bow.

60
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:09,520
Just keep up the good work with the accounts.

61
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:10,240
Yes.

62
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,400
Teach them well.

63
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,160
I will do my best

64
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:16,490
to live up to your trust.

65
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:33,160
You have something on your mind, Pavilion Master.

66
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:37,800
Now that Yanzhi Pavilion is exclusively for the royal family,

67
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:39,800
and you are all here on weekdays,

68
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:42,079
our foundation is solid.

69
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:43,600
I want

70
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:46,200
to open a branch in Nanzhou.

71
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:47,960
Pavilion Master,

72
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:50,079
is there someone you can't let go of?

73
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:53,320
Even if I can't let go,

74
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:55,780
he is already the Lord of Kuizhou.

75
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:57,880
Having taken on this heavy responsibility,

76
00:03:57,880 --> 00:03:59,880
he has his own things to accomplish.

77
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:01,760
And I

78
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:04,720
also have things to accomplish.

79
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:49,159
Back then,

80
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:51,680
I told you, Lady Fang,

81
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:54,520
never to touch that poisonous rouge again.

82
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:56,960
Now,

83
00:04:57,520 --> 00:04:59,650
the toxins have spread from your heart

84
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:01,880
to your whole body.

85
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:13,320
How much time do I have left?

86
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:15,800
At most,

87
00:05:17,760 --> 00:05:18,680
one month.

88
00:06:12,520 --> 00:06:13,920
You didn't even say a word

89
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:15,600
before leaving.

90
00:06:18,120 --> 00:06:19,080
Haven't you been

91
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:21,320
training troops these days?

92
00:06:22,400 --> 00:06:25,400
Running back here and leaving General Cheng and the others behind,

93
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:28,330
aren't you afraid they'll tear down the racecourse?

94
00:06:29,200 --> 00:06:30,330
These past few days,

95
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:33,520
they haven't been discussing the defense.

96
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:36,130
They've been discussing my marriage.

97
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,200
Chu Shengyi.

98
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,930
I have feelings for you.

99
00:06:55,200 --> 00:06:57,730
It really feels much better to say it out loud.

100
00:07:00,640 --> 00:07:01,970
Don't say anything yet.

101
00:07:03,200 --> 00:07:04,440
Let me finish.

102
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:09,280
I don't know when it started,

103
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:11,560
but that doesn't matter.

104
00:07:13,280 --> 00:07:14,960
I just wanted you to know.

105
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:21,400
We

106
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:26,210
both have our own paths to take.

107
00:07:30,280 --> 00:07:31,080
Then let's

108
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,360
say goodbye here.

109
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:52,880
This is...

110
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:55,580
A parting gift.

111
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:03,620
These carrier pigeons

112
00:08:03,760 --> 00:08:05,280
were trained by me personally.

113
00:08:05,280 --> 00:08:07,410
They remember the way back to Kuizhou.

114
00:08:08,840 --> 00:08:09,560
Okay.

115
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:38,140
Be careful on the road.

116
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:03,480
In the future...

117
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,240
I

118
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:07,200
had warned Madam Fang before.

119
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:09,000
She must never again

120
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:11,520
use that poisonous rouge.

121
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:13,520
If she

122
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:15,640
insists on using it,

123
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:17,760
in less than a month,

124
00:09:18,280 --> 00:09:20,280
her life will wither away.

125
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:39,760
Not long after,

126
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:42,080
bad news came from Quentan.

127
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:43,920
The Khan died suddenly,

128
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:46,880
and the young prince Yelu Hula succeeded him.

129
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:48,760
The flames of war reignited,

130
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:52,960
and war drums beat again on the Kuizhou and Quentan border.

131
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,240
This battle

132
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:56,960
lasted for a full three years.

133
00:09:57,360 --> 00:10:00,040
After years of bitter fighting,

134
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:02,400
Chu Shengyi finally defeated Quentan

135
00:10:02,400 --> 00:10:04,160
at Kuishui yesterday.

136
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:38,600
Where have you been all these years?

137
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,740
I thought you were already...

138
00:10:41,920 --> 00:10:42,760
Originally,

139
00:10:42,760 --> 00:10:45,620
I wanted to find a beautiful place to wait for death.

140
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:48,040
Perhaps I wasn't meant to die,

141
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:49,720
I met a wandering doctor.

142
00:10:50,920 --> 00:10:51,980
It took three years

143
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:54,600
to completely clear the poison from the rouge.

144
00:11:36,520 --> 00:11:37,980
This must still be a dream,

145
00:11:38,760 --> 00:11:39,400
right?

146
00:11:51,880 --> 00:11:53,340
This is not a dream, right?

147
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,000
This is not a dream.

148
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:07,440
I really missed you.

149
00:12:28,800 --> 00:12:30,520
Why are you here?

150
00:12:37,160 --> 00:12:38,240
Earlier this year,

151
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:40,080
I gradually opened branches

152
00:12:40,520 --> 00:12:42,250
of Yanzhi Pavilion in Nanzhou.

153
00:12:43,640 --> 00:12:45,080
It's close to Quentan,

154
00:12:45,840 --> 00:12:47,360
so trade is inevitable.

155
00:12:49,280 --> 00:12:51,010
Hearing that you were trapped,

156
00:12:51,640 --> 00:12:52,720
I had someone

157
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:54,640
add something special

158
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:56,960
to the goods sent to Quentan.

159
00:12:58,320 --> 00:12:59,600
The fire last night,

160
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:01,880
was it to your liking?

161
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:04,140
Thank you, my wife,

162
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,620
for relieving my army.

163
00:13:14,240 --> 00:13:15,760
The Lord of Kuizhou

164
00:13:16,880 --> 00:13:18,320
never marrying,

165
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:20,080
is that okay?

166
00:13:25,920 --> 00:13:27,360
I already have a wife.

167
00:13:39,920 --> 00:13:41,920
The divorce letter is still with me.

168
00:13:42,560 --> 00:13:43,360
Then I will

169
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:44,800
propose again.

170
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:47,880
Hold a wedding for you,

171
00:13:48,760 --> 00:13:50,960
a wedding that belongs to Fang Zhuozhuo

172
00:13:51,280 --> 00:13:52,840
and Chu Shengyi.

173
00:14:00,640 --> 00:14:01,320
No.

174
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:03,960
Why?

175
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:07,200
This time,

176
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:10,080
let me propose.

177
00:14:10,640 --> 00:14:12,000
I've already given you the betrothal gifts.
